{"path":"/services/technical-seo/","slug":"services__technical-seo","kind":"service","title":"Trade Compliance | Customs Compliance Software | KlearNow","description":"Keep classifications, PGA checks, and entry rules aligned before filing—with traceable data and audit-ready records on the KlearNow platform.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/technical-seo.KHIYXi0C.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Services</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Technical SEO Agency</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The pages that carry your pipeline get found, indexed and kept there. We find what is blocking them, fix it in the build ourselves, and re-crawl every month, so a fix stays fixed and a regression shows up in the next report instead of in next year&#39;s traffic.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Found and Fixed</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Why Most Technical Audits Change Nothing</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M6 6L18 6\"/><path d=\"M6 10H18\"/><path d=\"M13 14L18 14\"/><path d=\"M13 18L18 18\"/><path d=\"M2 21.4V2.6C2 2.26863 2.26863 2 2.6 2H21.4C21.7314 2 22 2.26863 22 2.6V21.4C22 21.7314 21.7314 22 21.4 22H2.6C2.26863 22 2 21.7314 2 21.4Z\"/><path d=\"M6 18V14H9V18H6Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The engagement ends with a hundred-page PDF</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The engagement ends with a hundred-page PDF and a list of issues sorted by severity. Someone has to build all of it, that someone was never scoped, and the list is stale within a quarter.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 6L20 6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 5.79999L4.60002 6.59998L6.60001 4.59999\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 11.8L4.60002 12.6L6.60001 10.6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 17.8L4.60002 18.6L6.60001 16.6\"/><path d=\"M9 12L20 12\"/><path d=\"M9 18L20 18\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A tool flags 4,000 issues that mostly do not matter</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A tool flags four thousand issues and most of them do not matter. Without someone who can tell a real indexing problem from a warning, the budget goes on the wrong four thousandth.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M15 4V2M15 4V6M15 4H10.5M3 10V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21H19C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V10H3Z\"/><path d=\"M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H7\"/><path d=\"M7 2V6\"/><path d=\"M21 10V6C21 4.89543 20.1046 4 19 4H18.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The next CMS change reintroduces half the fixes</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The fixes ship, the audit closes, and the next CMS change quietly reintroduces half of them. Nobody notices until traffic falls two quarters later, and by then it is a board question.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A finding becomes a change on the site</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>We build the site, so a finding turns into a change we ship rather than a ticket for a team who were never briefed. Nothing gets recommended that we are not willing to build ourselves.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The pages that carry your pipeline come first</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Findings are ordered by the traffic and revenue behind the affected pages. A canonical error on a page nobody visits stays at the bottom of the list where it belongs.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A regression shows up in next month’s report</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The site gets crawled on the same cadence as everything else we measure, so a regression shows up in the next report rather than in next year’s audit, while it is still cheap to reverse.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Technical SEO Services</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Things That Decide Whether a Page Is Found</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Crawl and Index</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A page an engine never reaches cannot rank, convert or be cited. Canonicals, redirects, sitemaps, robots rules, and the junk URLs that eat a crawl budget before the real pages get seen.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M13 10V3L5 14H11V21L19 10H13Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Speed and Core Web Vitals</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A slow page loses the visit before the form loads and ranks below faster ones. Field data first, lab data second: image weight, font loading, third-party scripts and layout shift, measured on the pages that carry traffic.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Structure and Schema</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The markup that tells an engine what a page is and what to quote from it. One H1, a heading order that reflects the page, main content an engine can separate from the navigation, and schema per page type that describes what is there.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5 12V18C5 18 5 21 12 21C19 21 19 18 19 18V12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M5 6V12C5 12 5 15 12 15C19 15 19 12 19 12V6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M12 3C19 3 19 6 19 6C19 6 19 9 12 9C5 9 5 6 5 6C5 6 5 3 12 3Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Machine Readability</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The layer that decides whether an AI assistant can use the page at all: clean markup, a resolvable llms.txt, no content locked behind script, and internal links that resolve.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section proof\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><div class=\"container proof__grid\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><div class=\"proof__text\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>What It Moves</span><h2 class=\"proof__heading\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Google Clicks Up 90% in Four Months on One Site</h2><p data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>K2 Relocate ranked for nothing commercial at the start of the engagement. The work was unglamorous: structure, internal linking, the markup that tells an engine what a page is, and the crawl waste that was burning attention on URLs nobody should ever see.</p><p data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Four months later it is the fastest-growing site in a six-site estate, and its average position across the site reached 14.7, the best it has recorded. The board saw that line on a monthly report.</p><p class=\"proof__note\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Nothing about that is a redesign. The pages largely say what they said in April.</p></div><div class=\"proof__viz\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><figure class=\"line\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><figcaption class=\"line__title\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>K2 Relocate: clicks from Google, four straight months of growth</figcaption><div class=\"line__plot\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"K2 Relocate: clicks from Google, four straight months of growth. April: 105, May: 149, June: 167, July: 200\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><defs data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><linearGradient id=\"lc-5863\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><stop offset=\"0%\" class=\"line__grad-a\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></stop><stop offset=\"100%\" class=\"line__grad-b\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></stop></linearGradient></defs><g data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><line class=\"line__grid\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"586\" y1=\"266\" y2=\"266\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></line><text class=\"line__ytick\" x=\"34\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>0</text></g><g data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><line class=\"line__grid\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"586\" y1=\"186.66666666666666\" y2=\"186.66666666666666\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></line><text class=\"line__ytick\" x=\"34\" y=\"190.66666666666666\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>77</text></g><g data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><line class=\"line__grid\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"586\" y1=\"107.33333333333331\" y2=\"107.33333333333331\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></line><text class=\"line__ytick\" x=\"34\" y=\"111.33333333333331\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>153</text></g><g data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><line class=\"line__grid\" x1=\"44\" x2=\"586\" y1=\"28\" y2=\"28\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></line><text class=\"line__ytick\" x=\"34\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>230</text></g><path class=\"line__area\" d=\"M44.0,157.3 L224.7,111.8 L405.3,93.2 L586.0,59.0 L586.0,266.0 L44.0,266.0 Z\" fill=\"url(#lc-5863)\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></path><path class=\"line__path\" d=\"M44.0,157.3 L224.7,111.8 L405.3,93.2 L586.0,59.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></path><g data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><circle class=\"line__dot\" cx=\"44\" cy=\"157.34782608695653\" r=\"4.5\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></circle><text class=\"line__xtick\" x=\"44\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>April</text><text class=\"line__vlabel\" x=\"54\" y=\"145.34782608695653\" text-anchor=\"start\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>105</text></g><g data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><circle class=\"line__dot\" cx=\"224.66666666666666\" cy=\"111.81739130434781\" r=\"4.5\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></circle><text class=\"line__xtick\" x=\"224.66666666666666\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>May</text></g><g data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><circle class=\"line__dot\" cx=\"405.3333333333333\" cy=\"93.19130434782608\" r=\"4.5\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></circle><text class=\"line__xtick\" x=\"405.3333333333333\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>June</text></g><g data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm><circle class=\"line__dot\" cx=\"586\" cy=\"59.04347826086956\" r=\"4.5\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm></circle><text class=\"line__xtick\" x=\"586\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>July</text><text class=\"line__vlabel\" x=\"596\" y=\"47.04347826086956\" text-anchor=\"end\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>200</text></g></svg></div><p class=\"line__source\" data-astro-cid-dwn4dnrm>Google Search Console, April to July 2026. Clicks to one site in the K2 Group estate. Axis starts at zero.</p></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"section crawl\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><div class=\"crawl__head\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Crawl Waste</span><h2 class=\"crawl__heading\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Most Estates Spend Their Crawl on Nothing</h2><p class=\"crawl__sub\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>An engine gives your site a finite amount of attention. On a large site most of it goes on parameter URLs, filtered views and pages that should never have been reachable. Every one of those is attention not spent on a page you want quoted.</p></div><div class=\"crawl__rings\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><figure class=\"ring\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc><div class=\"ring__plot\" style=\"--ring-size:168px\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc><svg width=\"168\" height=\"168\" viewBox=\"0 0 168 168\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Less crawler time on junk URLs: 83%\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc><circle class=\"ring__track\" cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"77\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"14\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc></circle><circle class=\"ring__arc ring__arc--ink\" cx=\"84\" cy=\"84\" r=\"77\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"14\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"401.55837298184736 483.80526865282815\" transform=\"rotate(-90 84 84)\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc></circle></svg><span class=\"ring__value\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc><span class=\"ring__num\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc>83<span class=\"ring__suffix\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc>%</span></span></span></div><figcaption class=\"ring__caption\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc><span class=\"ring__label\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc>Less crawler time on junk URLs</span><span class=\"ring__source\" data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc>ChannelSight, after the crawl and index rebuild</span></figcaption></figure><div class=\"crawl__stat\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><span class=\"crawl__stat-value\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>475</span><span class=\"crawl__stat-label\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>pages made machine-readable</span><span class=\"crawl__stat-source\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>The estate an engine can now separate from its own navigation</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section audit\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><div class=\"container audit__grid\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><div class=\"audit__viz\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><figure class=\"bars\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__list\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__row bars__row--hi\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__label\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><span data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>Crawl and index</span></div><div class=\"bars__track\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__fill\" style=\"width:100%\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq></div></div><span class=\"bars__value\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>35%</span></div><div class=\"bars__row\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__label\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><span data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>Structure and schema</span></div><div class=\"bars__track\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__fill\" style=\"width:71.42857142857143%\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq></div></div><span class=\"bars__value\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>25%</span></div><div class=\"bars__row\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__label\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><span data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>Speed and vitals</span></div><div class=\"bars__track\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__fill\" style=\"width:71.42857142857143%\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq></div></div><span class=\"bars__value\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>25%</span></div><div class=\"bars__row\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__label\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><span data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>Machine readability</span></div><div class=\"bars__track\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq><div class=\"bars__fill\" style=\"width:42.857142857142854%\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq></div></div><span class=\"bars__value\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>15%</span></div></div><figcaption class=\"bars__source\" data-astro-cid-4ddkebpq>How the audit weights its four areas. This is our scoring sheet, not a finding about any particular site: crawl and index carries the most because an unindexed page cannot rank, cannot convert and cannot be cited.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"audit__text\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>The Technical SEO Audit</span><h2 class=\"audit__heading\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Findings Are Ordered by What They Cost You</h2><p data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>A crawler will hand you four thousand issues sorted by its own idea of severity. That ordering knows nothing about your traffic, so it will put a canonical warning on a page nobody visits above an indexing problem on the page that carries your pipeline.</p><p data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>We re-rank every finding against the sessions and the revenue behind the affected pages, then draw a line. Below the line goes in the appendix and stays there.</p><p class=\"proof__note\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>The report reads as a work order: what to change, in what order, and what each change protects.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section regress\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><div class=\"regress__head\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Why the Crawl Runs Monthly</span><h2 class=\"regress__heading\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Fixes Do Not Stay Fixed</h2></div><div class=\"regress__grid\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><article class=\"regress__card\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><h3 data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>A template edit</h3><p data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>One change to a shared component reaches every page using it. A heading level moved, a canonical dropped, a link turned into a button, and a hundred pages change behaviour at once.</p></article><article class=\"regress__card\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><h3 data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>A CMS migration</h3><p data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Slugs change, redirects get half-written, and the old URLs stay in the index for months pointing at nothing. This is the most common way a site loses traffic it had already earned.</p></article><article class=\"regress__card\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><h3 data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>A page published outside the process</h3><p data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>A campaign landing page goes up in a hurry with no meta description, no schema and a noindex left on from staging. Nobody notices, because nobody is crawling.</p></article><article class=\"regress__card\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75><h3 data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>A third-party script</h3><p data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>A tag manager container grows by a script a month until the page takes four seconds to become interactive on a mid-range phone. No single change caused it, which is why no single person owns it.</p></article></div><p class=\"regress__foot\" data-astro-cid-diqpbc75>Each of these is cheap to catch the month it happens and expensive to find two quarters later, which is the entire argument for a monthly crawl rather than an annual audit.</p></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/channelsight.png\" alt=\"ChannelSight\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>475 pages made machine-readable, from zero.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>We cut crawler time on junk URLs by 83% and rebuilt how the estate is structured, so the pages that matter are the pages engines spend their time on. ChannelSight is now the most-cited domain in its own AI answer set.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/channelsight/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/covers/case-channelsight.jpg\" alt=\"A lit building facade in a regular grid, rendered as a blue pixel dither, captioned Readable to AI engines\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With a Crawl</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out What Is Costing You Traffic</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A call about your site, your traffic and what is currently getting in the way of it. You will leave knowing what we would do first and why, whether or not you go ahead.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>What the crawl, index, speed and structure work covers</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How findings get ordered by the traffic and revenue behind each page</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Where we can fix things in the build, and where we cannot</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/aeo-agency/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How this connects to AI search</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What is technical SEO?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Everything that decides whether a search engine can reach your pages, understand them and keep them in its index. It covers crawling, indexing, site speed, structure, markup and internal linking. It does not cover what the pages say, which is content, or who links to them, which is authority.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How is a technical SEO audit different from what a tool gives me?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>A tool lists everything it can detect, weighted by its own severity scale rather than by your traffic. An audit is someone deciding which of those findings matter for your site, in what order, and what the fix actually is. The list is the input; the work order is the deliverable.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you fix the problems or just report them?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>We fix them. We build the sites, so a finding turns into a change on the site rather than a recommendation handed to a development team who were never briefed. Where a fix sits in a system we do not control, we say so and scope it separately.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How often should a technical audit run?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>A full pass once a year, and a monthly crawl in between. Most damage comes from ordinary changes: a template edit, a CMS migration, a marketing page published outside the usual process. Monthly catches those while they are still cheap to reverse.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Does technical SEO matter for AI search?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It decides whether the page can be used at all. An engine that cannot crawl your page, or that cannot separate your content from your navigation, has nothing to quote. Technical work alone will not earn a citation, and its absence reliably costs one.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-5\" id=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you work on sites that are not on Webflow?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>For audit and diagnosis, yes. For implementation, it depends what the site runs on and who owns the deploy. We say clearly where we can ship the fix ourselves and where you would be handed a list to give someone else.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".ring[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{align-items:center;gap:var(--sp-2);text-align:center;flex-direction:column;display:flex}.ring__plot[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{width:var(--ring-size);height:var(--ring-size);position:relative}.ring__track[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{stroke:#201d1d1f}.ring--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc] .ring__track[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{stroke:#ffffff2e}.ring__arc--blue[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{stroke:var(--blue)}.ring__arc--lime[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{stroke:var(--lime)}.ring__arc--ink[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{stroke:var(--ink)}.ring--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc] .ring__arc--ink[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{stroke:var(--white)}.ring__value[data-astro-cid-ob2ujwlc]{justify-cont